cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this Lean formalization, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "elliptic-bernoulli-foundations: the elliptic one-phase Bernoulli free boundary problem in Lean"
version: "0.3.0"
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/willmfeldman/elliptic-bernoulli-foundations"
authors:
  - family-names: Feldman
    given-names: "William M."
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of foundational results for the elliptic one-phase Bernoulli
  free boundary problem with a variable coefficient: existence and continuity for obstacle
  problems for the Alt–Caffarelli energy, energy-decreasing perturbations and one-sided
  minimizers as viscosity solutions, the Lipschitz estimate, non-degeneracy, De Silva's
  flatness theory up to classical regularity, classical solutions, and the classification of
  planar 1-homogeneous inner variational solutions.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - Mathlib
  - formalized mathematics
  - free boundary problems
  - Bernoulli problem
  - one-phase problem
  - viscosity solutions
